    You can only use each of the following effects of "Paleozoic Cambroraster" once
    per turn. You can target 1 Set card in the Spell & Trap Zone; send it to the
    GY, and if you do, Set 1 "Paleozoic" Trap directly from your Deck. It can be
    activated this turn. If a Set card(s) you control would be destroyed by card
    effect, you can banish this card from your field or GY instead.'
